      <p>A small core, and a network that scales with what's actually being built.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="core-network">
      <div class="core-cell">
        <h4>Core team</h4>
        <p class="core-meta">Fixed salary + benefits</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Owns the platform, the standards, the customers, and the direction</li>
