      </div>
      <div class="core-cell">
        <h4>Independent partners</h4>
        <p class="core-meta">Variable cost — project fee, revenue share, or royalty</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Developers</li>
          <li>UI/UX</li>
          <li>QA</li>
          <li>DevOps</li>
          <li>Security specialists</li>
          <li>Researchers</li>
          <li>Technical writers</li>
        </ul>
